<title>USA: New Iberia Bancorp Inc sets qtly div.</title>
<headline>New Iberia Bancorp Inc sets qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW IBERIA, La. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Iberia Bancorp Inc said it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.08 per share to be paid on April 30 to shareholders of record on April 18.</p>
<p>The prior dividend paid in January 1996 for the fourth quarter was $0.15 per share.</p>
<p>The company said that its fourth quarter dividend is usually higher than its dividend for other quarters.</p>
